  "description": "The Klunkerson is inspired from a simpler time. When friends would help friends piece together old beach cruisers to race each other down dirt roads and see who would get to the bottom first, laughing and dusting each other out along the way. When we spoke to Dennis about making a non-BMX bike for him to ride, he wanted a bike that was comfortable enough to cruise the beach for miles but capable enough to boost a kicker and slash a berm if the opportunity presented itself. The Klunkerson is that bike, comfortable and capable.",
